	* ExpiryManager 0.12.0
	  Split the expiry reminder into separate expired / expiring-soon
	  notifications. Previously a single notification lumped
	  already-overdue products together with ones merely approaching
	  their reminder lead time, so its title (e.g. "2 products expiring
	  soon") could be misleading when the mix included expired items.
