2026-07-19      Bogdan Drozdowski <bogdro #at# users . sourceforge . net>

	* ExpiryManager 0.1.0
	  Project skeleton: Gradle setup, wrapper, and minimal launcher screen.
	  Sets up the Java/Gradle Android project (AGP 8.5.2, Gradle 8.7,
	  minSdk 26), the app's visual resources (theme, colors, launcher
	  icon, layouts), and a placeholder MainActivity so the module builds
	  and launches end to end before any feature code lands.

	  Add Room persistence layer: entities, DAOs, converters Product and
	  BarcodeDefaults entities plus their DAOs, backed by an AppDatabase
	  singleton forced into TRUNCATE journal mode so the on-disk .db file
	  is always a complete snapshot for later export/import. Includes
	  the shared app-wide Constants used throughout the rest of the
	  codebase.

	  Add repository, barcode scanning, export/import, and reminder support
	  - ProductRepository: single source of truth for the UI layer,
	  wrapping Room DAO access on a background executor.
	  - BarcodeScanHelper: wraps zxing-android-embedded's scan contract
	  plus the CAMERA runtime permission flow.
	  - DbExportManager/DbImportManager: share the SQLite file via the
	  system share sheet, and import one back with schema validation, a
	  safety backup of the current data, and rollback on failure.
	  - reminder/*: WorkManager-driven daily expiry check, notification
	  channel/summary builder, and the lazy POST_NOTIFICATIONS request
	  flow.

	  Wire up product list, add/edit, and settings screens
	  - MainActivity/MainViewModel/ProductListAdapter: the expiry-sorted
